      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel trapped when you believe the external damage is permanent. However, even when things seem overwhelmingly broken, the perception of finality is often distorted by emotional distress. There are paths to rebuilding, even if they don't look like a complete return to your past self. Please consider speaking with someone who can help you redefine what a valuable life looks like, separate from past career events.",
      "source": "target",
