      "content": "The exhaustion you describe from constantly performing a false front is immense, and it takes incredible strength just to keep showing up. While the feelings of being erased feel completely real to you right now, those subjective experiences can be powerfully distorted by intense mental pain. Speaking with a therapist can help you find tools to manage this crushing isolation, even if the external circumstances haven't changed yet. You don't have to bear this profound weight entirely by yourself.",
